> 
> Is there a setting , in FreeBSD I need to change?

The dc driver uses the ew*0* settings of the SRM console. Do a SHOW EW*
from SRM to see what I mean. You can hard-set it to 10 or 100 or FullDuplex
or to auto-negotiate. I generally hard-set them. SET EW*_MODE ? tells you
more

